DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
31904::$$$message_0250_0000_0000$$$::I decide to check out the neighborhood directly across Miyama from my house.[lr]::
31905::$$$message_0250_0000_0001$$$::We walk all the way up the hill until we reach Tohsaka's house, but don't come across anything suspicious.::
31906::$$$message_0250_0001_0000$$$::"If I may ask, what do you think of the differences between Rin and Sakura's houses, Shirou?"[lr]::
31907::$$$message_0250_0001_0001$$$::"What do you mean? I've never really thought about it before.[lr]::
31908::$$$message_0250_0001_0002$$$::Is there something that brought this up? Did you notice anything weird about them?"::
31909::$$$message_0250_0002_0000$$$::"Huh? [cacheimage storage=セイバー鎧06b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー鎧06b(中)]N-no, this has nothing to do with our patrol. I've been wondering about it for a while, [cacheimage storage=セイバー鎧01c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー鎧01c(中)]but I felt uncomfortable asking them directly."[lr]::
31910::$$$message_0250_0002_0001$$$::"Uncomfortable? So it's a question about magecraft?"::
31911::$$$message_0250_0003_0000$$$::"...Yes, and no.[lr]::
31912::$$$message_0250_0003_0001$$$::Sakura's house is obviously the larger of the two, but the Tohsakas govern this land.[lr]::
31913::$$$message_0250_0003_0002$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー鎧04a(中)]It just doesn't seem right that the lord of this domain resides in a home smaller than that of her subject."::
31914::$$$message_0250_0004_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
31915::$$$message_0250_0004_0001$$$::I know Saber isn't the type to obsess over wealth. In fact, I wish she cared a little more about money.[lr]::
31916::$$$message_0250_0004_0002$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー鎧04e(中)]But sometimes, I'm reminded that she has the troublesome standards of a former monarch.[lr]::
31917::$$$message_0250_0004_0003$$$::As you might expect from royalty, she seems to have the idea that the ruler of a land should conduct themselves in a way that befits their status.[lr]::
31918::$$$message_0250_0004_0004$$$::Anyway...::
31919::$$$message_0250_0005_0000$$$::"What do you think? I understand that Rin may not want to exploit her close family, but this is her obligation as a ruler. Don't you agree that she should either expand the Tohsaka estate or seize the Matous' assets before any pointless friction arises?"[lr]::
31920::$$$message_0250_0005_0001$$$::If she actually says that to them, it might actually lead to a sibling fight that could burn Fuyuki to the ground.[lr]::
31921::$$$message_0250_0005_0002$$$::What really scares me is that Tohsaka would definitely agree with her.::
31922::$$$message_0250_0006_0000$$$::"Don't tell Tohsaka that. She might be in charge, but only from the shadows.[lr]::
31923::$$$message_0250_0006_0001$$$::She can't allow herself to stand out, and I can tell she's been trying to live her life while keeping a low profile."::
31924::$$$message_0250_0007_0000$$$::"Hm... That's true, now that you mention it.[lr]::
31925::$$$message_0250_0007_0001$$$::Rin's usual self-restraint is meant to conceal the fact that the Tohsakas rule this land."::
31926::$$$message_0250_0008_0000$$$::"Yeah. So no matter what, don't go up to her and say something like 'you live an awfully poor life, Rin.' I'll be the one who pays for it."[lr]::
31927::$$$message_0250_0008_0001$$$::"You're right. As Rin's friend,[cacheimage storage=セイバー鎧12c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー鎧12c(中)] I should pretend not to notice her struggles."[lr]::
31928::$$$message_0250_0008_0002$$$::Tohsaka's lucky to have friends who understand her.[lr]::
31929::$$$message_0250_0008_0003$$$::[font italic=true]Misunderstand[font italic=false] her, rather, but all's well that ends well.::
31930::$$$message_0250_0009_0000$$$::"Now that we've sorted that out, why don't we head back? There's nothing to see here."[lr]::
31931::$$$message_0250_0009_0001$$$::The night grows older.[lr]::
31932::$$$message_0250_0009_0002$$$::I should take care of my other business before the moon is directly overhead.::
931904::$$$message_9250_0000_0000$$$::I decide to check out the neighborhood directly across Miyama from my house.[r]:}��